				</TABLE>
			</TD>
			<TD width=10></TD>
			<TD width=570 valign=top>
				<SPAN class=MainHeading style="display:inline;width:460px; height:21px">Help Desk Services</SPAN><SPAN class=Copyright style="padding-top:6px;padding-right:25px;display:inline;width:110px;HEIGHT:21px;cursor:hand;BACKGROUND-IMAGE:url('Images/PrintArrow.gif')" onclick="window.print()">Print this page</SPAN>
				
				
				<P>There are various methods of contacting the Helpdesk. A summary of these methods is listed below:</P>
 
				<P><SPAN class=SubHeading>Phone:</SPAN> Our easy to remember number is, <B>1300 OXIANA (1300 694262)</B> from anywhere inside Australia. If you are calling from outside Australia you can still call us but will need to use our international number <B>+61 8 9321 9072</B>.</P>
				<P>The desk is currently manned:</P>
				<TABLE>
					<TR>
						<TD width=200>&nbsp;</TD>
						<TD width=100><B>Weekdays</B></TD>
						<TD width=100><B>Weekends</B></TD>
					</TR>
					<TR>
						<TD><B>Australian Central Daylight Time</B></TD><TD>6:30am  8:30pm</TD><TD>8:30am  8:30pm</TD>
					</TR>
					<TR>
						<TD><B>Australian Eastern Daylight Time</B></TD><TD>7am  9pm</TD><TD>9am  9pm</TD>
					</TR>
					<TR>
						<TD><B>Australian Eastern Standard Time</B></TD><TD>6am  8pm</TD><TD>8am  8pm</TD>
					</TR>
					<TR>
						<TD><B>Australian Western Daylight Time</B></TD><TD>5am  6pm</TD><TD>6am  6pm</TD>
					</TR>
				</TABLE>
				
				<P><SPAN class=SubHeading>Voicemail:</SPAN> Outside of the Helpdesk hours there is a voicemail service where you can leave a message that will be actioned when the Helpdesk next opens.</P>
				<P><SPAN class=SubHeading>Email:</SPAN> You can send email 24hrs a day to <A href="mailto:redacted@example.com">redacted@example.com</A> and it will be responded to as quickly as possible. This is a great way of logging non-urgent or 'out of hours' calls. We do not recommend logging <B>urgent</B> calls via email as phones will always take precedence. </P>
				<P><SPAN class=SubHeading>Automatic alerts:</SPAN> Automatically generated alerts are sent from most technical equipment in the event of an outage, so we are able to pro-actively detect any major issues and fix them, hopefully before you even notice there's a problem!</P>
				 
				<P><SPAN class=SubHeading>Self-service:</SPAN> Coming soon! An intranet page where you will be able to log, track and update your own calls via the Oxiana intranet.</P>
				<P>If you have any feedback regarding the helpdesk Services please contact the Helpdesk Manager, Russell Toyn with your comments. <A href="mailto:redacted@example.com">redacted@example.com</A>

				<DIV class=Copyright><BR>This page last updated: 14 Dec 2006 (Empired)</DIV>
			</TD>
